RUNG 3 — around: grep for a pile
  Everything said about a string: every line touching it, and every line about those
  lines. grep finds the text; this finds what was said about it.

  usage:  3-around tomas FILE.eoe ...

touching(end) = lines with end as their left, and lines with end as their right

for each string asked:
    for each line in touching(string):
        print show(line)
        for each note in touching(line's id):      the words it carries, where it came from
            print "    " show(note)
